# Root-level gitignore
# Protects docker compose env substitution file from accidental commit
.env

# Defensive: node_modules should only ever exist inside mad_sessionops_frontend/
# (which has its own .gitignore), but a stray root-level one can appear if a
# tool like `npx` is accidentally invoked from the repo root instead of that
# subdirectory. This rule ensures such an accident is never stageable.
node_modules/
